  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kochu Kadeeja Yousafali vs Vatanappally Grama Panchayat on 1 July, 2025 Author: C.S.Dias Bench: C.S.Dias Wp(C) No. 24066 Of 2025 1 2025:Ker:47912 In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr.Justice C.S.Dias Tuesday, The 1St Day Of July 2025 / 10Th Ashadha, 1947 Wp(C) No. 24066 Of 2025 Petitioner/S: Kochu Kadeeja Yousafali Aged 68 Years W/O. Yousafali, Chandana Parambil, Valappad, Chavakkad, Thrissur District, Kerala, Pin - 680567 By Advs. Shri.M.R.Dhanil Smt.Senitta P. Jojo Smt.Jishy P.S. Smt.Vidhuna Narayanan Respondent/S: 1 Vatanappally Grama Panchayat Represented By Its Secretary, Corporation Office, Thrissur District, Kerala, Pin - 680614 2 Secretary Vatanappally Grama Panchayat, Corporation Office, Thrissur District, Kerala, Pin - 680614 Kochu Kadeeja Yousafali vs Vatanappally Grama Panchayat on 1 July, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/16745054/ 1",
    "facts": "2. The petitioner is residing within the territorial limits of the 1st respondent Panchayat. The petitioner had carried out minor repairs in his residence. Now the 2 nd respondent issued Ext.P3 notice to the petitioner pointing out certain differences in the construction. Even though the petitioner submitted Ext.P4 representation before the 2 nd respondent on 11.06.2025, the same has not been considered till date. The petitioner is apprehensive that the respondents may take coercive proceedings pursuant to Ext.P3 notice.",
